# Optional. Without it the app still works: geocoding falls back to Photon
# and Street View reports "not configured" rather than breaking.
#
# Google Cloud: enable Geocoding API, Street View Static API, Elevation API.
# The key is held SERVER-SIDE only and is never sent to the browser, so it
# does not need an HTTP-referrer restriction — restrict it by API instead.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
